{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41474","headline":"和致仕沈郎中 · 李建勳","name":"和致仕沈郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欲谋休退尚因循，且向东溪种白苹。\n谬应星辰居四辅，终期冠褐作闲人。\n城中隔日趋朝嬾，楚外千峯入梦频。\n残照晚庭沈醉醒，静吟斜倚老松身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41474.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41474","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}